### 1. CADASTRO DE USUÁRIO
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Maria",
  "surname": "Silva",
  "email": "maria@mail.com",
  "password": "123@123",
  "confirmPassword": "123@123"
}

### 2. Login (gera o token)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/user/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@mail.com",
  "password": "123@123"
}

### 3. Erro esperado: senhas diferentes (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Joao",
  "surname": "Souza",
  "email": "joao@mail.com",
  "password": "123@123",
  "confirmPassword": "outra"
}

### 4. Erro esperado: senha errada no login (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/user/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@mail.com",
  "password": "errada"
}

### ===== ETAPA 5: CRUD DE USUÁRIO =====

# Cole aqui o token recebido no login (sem aspas)
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiZW1haWwiOiJtYXJpYUBtYWlsLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc5NTMxNDE2NSwiZXhwIjoxNzk1MzE3NzY1fQ.EkI7wyiNEv2WxdV16Recguccz689voTmBxN0qPJ3xik

### 5. Buscar usuário por id (público, deve dar 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/user/1

### 6. Buscar usuário inexistente (deve dar 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/user/999

### 7. Atualizar usuário COM token (deve dar 204)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/user/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstname": "Maria",
  "surname": "Souza",
  "email": "maria@mail.com"
}

### 8. Atualizar SEM token (deve dar 401)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Maria",
  "surname": "Souza",
  "email": "maria@mail.com"
}

### 9. Atualizar com token inválido (deve dar 401)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/user/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token-falso

{
  "firstname": "Maria",
  "surname": "Souza",
  "email": "maria@mail.com"
}

### 10. Atualizar com dados incorretos (deve dar 400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/user/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstname": "Maria",
  "email": "email-invalido"
}

### 11. Atualizar usuário inexistente (deve dar 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/user/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstname": "Maria",
  "surname": "Souza",
  "email": "maria@mail.com"
}

### 12. Deletar SEM token (deve dar 401)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/user/1

### 13. Deletar usuário COM token (deve dar 204)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/user/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== ETAPA 6: CATEGORIAS =====

### 14. Criar categoria COM token (deve dar 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Shoes",
  "slug": "shoes",
  "use_in_menu": true
}

### 15. Criar mais duas (rode cada uma uma vez)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Black Friday",
  "slug": "black-friday",
  "use_in_menu": false
}

###
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Offers",
  "slug": "offers",
  "use_in_menu": true
}

### 16. Criar SEM token (deve dar 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/category
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teste",
  "slug": "teste"
}

### 17. Criar com dados incorretos, sem slug (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Sem slug"
}

### 18. Buscar por id (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/category/1

### 19. Buscar id inexistente (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/category/999

### 20. Listar com padrão: limit 12, page 1 (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/category/search

### 21. Listar todos (limit=-1)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/category/search?limit=-1

### 22. Paginação: 1 item por página, página 2
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/category/search?limit=1&page=2

### 23. Só campos name e slug
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/category/search?fields=name,slug

### 24. Só as que aparecem no menu
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/category/search?use_in_menu=true

### 25. Parâmetro inválido (deve dar 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/category/search?limit=abc

### 26. Campo inválido (deve dar 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/category/search?fields=senha

### 27. Atualizar (204)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/category/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Sapatos",
  "slug": "sapatos",
  "use_in_menu": true
}

### 28. Atualizar inexistente (404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/category/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "X",
  "slug": "x"
}

### 29. Deletar SEM token (401)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/category/2

### 30. Deletar COM token (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/category/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 31. Deletar de novo, agora inexistente (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/v1/category/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== ETAPA 7 (PARTE 1): PRODUTOS =====

### 32. Criar produto completo (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Tênis Runner",
  "slug": "tenis-runner",
  "stock": 10,
  "description": "Tênis leve para corrida",
  "price": 199.9,
  "price_with_discount": 149.9,
  "category_ids": [1, 3],
  "images": [
    {
      "type": "image/png",
      "content": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNkYPhfDwAChwGA60e6kgAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=="
    }
  ],
  "options": [
    { "title": "Tamanho", "shape": "square", "radius": 4, "type": "text", "values": ["40", "41", "42"] },
    { "title": "Cor", "shape": "circle", "type": "color", "values": ["#000", "#fff"] }
  ]
}

### 33. Criar um segundo produto, mais simples (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Camiseta Básica",
  "slug": "camiseta-basica",
  "stock": 50,
  "description": "Camiseta de algodão",
  "price": 59.9,
  "price_with_discount": 49.9,
  "category_ids": [3]
}

### 34. Criar SEM token (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/product
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "slug": "x", "price": 1, "price_with_discount": 1 }

### 35. Sem name (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "slug": "sem-nome", "price": 10, "price_with_discount": 9 }

### 36. Categoria inexistente (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "name": "Y", "slug": "y", "price": 10, "price_with_discount": 9, "category_ids": [999] }

### 37. Tipo de imagem inválido (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Z", "slug": "z", "price": 10, "price_with_discount": 9,
  "images": [{ "type": "image/gif", "content": "AAAA" }]
}

### 38. Buscar por id (200) - anote os ids das imagens e das opções
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1

### 39. Id inexistente (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/999

### 40. Listar com padrões (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/search

### 41. Paginação: 1 por página, página 2
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/search?limit=1&page=1

### 42. Só alguns campos
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/search?fields=name,images,price

### 43. Busca por texto no nome ou descrição
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/search?match=Runner

### 44. Por categoria
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/search?category_ids=1

### 45. Por faixa de preço (só o Tênis deve vir)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/search?price-range=100-200

### 46. Por opção: troque o 1 pelo id da opção "Tamanho" que apareceu no bloco 38
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/search?option[40]=40,42

### 47. Parâmetros inválidos (400)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/search?price-range=abc

###
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/search?limit=0


### ===== ETAPA 7 (PARTE 2): PUT E DELETE =====

### 48. Atualizar só os dados básicos (204)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Tênis Runner Pro",
  "slug": "tenis-runner-pro",
  "stock": 25,
  "description": "Versão atualizada",
  "price": 249.9,
  "price_with_discount": 199.9,
  "category_ids": [1]
}

### 49. Conferir: nome, estoque, preço e categorias devem ter mudado (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1

### 50. Adicionar uma imagem nova, sem id (204)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Tênis Runner Pro",
  "slug": "tenis-runner-pro",
  "price": 249.9,
  "price_with_discount": 199.9,
  "images": [
    {
      "type": "image/png",
      "content": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNkYPhfDwAChwGA60e6kgAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=="
    }
  ]
}

### 51. Conferir: agora são 2 imagens. Anote o id da nova (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1

### 52. Trocar o arquivo da imagem 1 (sem type) e manter a imagem 2 igual via URL (204)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Tênis Runner Pro",
  "slug": "tenis-runner-pro",
  "price": 249.9,
  "price_with_discount": 199.9,
  "images": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "content": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNkYPhfDwAChwGA60e6kgAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=="
    },
    { "id": 2, "content": "http://localhost:3000/media/qualquer-coisa.png" }
  ]
}

### 53. Apagar a imagem 2 (204): o arquivo some da pasta public/media
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Tênis Runner Pro",
  "slug": "tenis-runner-pro",
  "price": 249.9,
  "price_with_discount": 199.9,
  "images": [
    { "id": 2, "deleted": true }
  ]
}

### 54. Opções: alterar a 1, apagar a 2 e criar uma nova (204)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Tênis Runner Pro",
  "slug": "tenis-runner-pro",
  "price": 249.9,
  "price_with_discount": 199.9,
  "options": [
    { "id": 1, "radius": "10px", "value": ["38", "39", "40"] },
    { "id": 2, "deleted": true },
    { "title": "Material", "shape": "square", "type": "text", "values": ["100% algodão", "65% algodão"] }
  ]
}

### 55. Conferir as opções (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1

### 56. SEM token (401)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "slug": "x", "price": 1, "price_with_discount": 1 }

